  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Chop cauliflower (including stalk!) into small florets.\n• Place cauliflower on the lined oven tray. Top with sweet chilli sauce, Malaysian spice blend, and sprinkle with sesame seeds, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender and browned around the edges, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de82e6524c5d0a306c4a81/step-fdda529c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de82e6524c5d0a306c4a81/step-70650055.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Chop the broccoli (including the stalk!) into small florets. Cut carrot into thin sticks.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Stir-fry carrot and broccoli with a splash of water until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Add remaining garlic and soy sauce and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de82e6524c5d0a306c4a81/step-ce0fbc3a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice and soy veggies between bowls.\n• Top with sesame cauliflower and crushed peanuts.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de82e6524c5d0a306c4a81/step-2c1a0c46.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
